<div class="page-header">
  <h1 class="page-title">The second book (2017)</h1>
</div>

<div class="page-prose">
<img class="page-banner" src="{% static_image '/files/book/libro-banner-2.jpg' %}" alt="Cover of the second Lugares Míticos de Jaén book" loading="lazy">

<p>We went back to <a href="https://www.verkami.com/projects/18584-el-segundo-libro-de-lugares-miticos" rel="noopener">Verkami</a> in mid-September 2017. We asked for a minimum of €4,500 and raised around €5,500. As with the first book, the rest was the work contributed by the authors and the team.</p>
<p>Its sixteen chapters open with "Jaén, cerca y lejos", a piece by <strong>Antonio Muñoz Molina</strong>. The cover is the work of Juan Montoro Peralta, el Creata.</p>
<p>It was presented on 5 December 2017, again at the Old Chapel of the Hospital San Juan de Dios in Jaén.</p>

<h3 class="page-subsection--title">Where to find it</h3>
<p>A few copies may still be left in the bookshops that sold it: Metrópolis, Don Libro, Picasso and Delfos in Jaén; Libros Prohibidos and El Agente Secreto Libros in Úbeda; and San Antonio in Martos. Copies were also deposited in local and provincial libraries, where they should still be available: the <a href="https://www.juntadeandalucia.es/cultura/rbpa/abnetcl.cgi?TITN=2090550" rel="noopener">Andalusian public library network catalogue</a> shows which ones hold it (ISBN 978-84-697-6984-3). If you cannot find one, write to us at <a href="mailto:participa@lugaresmiticosdejaen.com">participa@lugaresmiticosdejaen.com</a>.</p>

